# Glue for owl.ttl: terms point rdfs:isDefinedBy at <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
# while the ontology is <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl>, so Visoto falls back to
# IRI-prefix membership, which only counts class and property types.
# owl:imports and owl:versionIRI are typed owl:OntologyProperty alone; that class
# is a subclass of rdf:Property, so the extra type is already entailed.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

owl:imports a rdf:Property .
owl:versionIRI a rdf:Property .
